      "cooked": "<p>How do you use the second ability on \"predator's eye\" card. The way i read it is that if you can only draw 2 cards and if &nbsp;X= 3 minus the nuber of cards draw you will always do -1 damage. &nbsp;Help! what am I missing?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
