    {
      "id": 125050,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-02T17:35:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kxiro79\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/c37758/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kxiro79:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How do you use the second ability on \"predator's eye\" card. The way i read it is that if you can only draw 2 cards and if &nbsp;X= 3 minus the nuber of cards draw you will always do -1 damage. &nbsp;Help! what am I missing?&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>3-2 = 1, not -1</p>\n<p>You may draw up to 2 cards, but you do not have to draw any cards if you wish. So X can be as high as 3 and as low as 1 depending on how many you wish to draw.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:59:11.117Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
