      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Kxiro79\"]\n\nHow do you use the second ability on &quot;predator&#39;s eye&quot; card. The way i read it is that if you can only draw 2 cards and if &nbsp;X= 3 minus the nuber of cards draw you will always do -1 damage. &nbsp;Help! what am I missing?&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\n3-2 = 1, not -1\n\nYou may draw up to 2 cards, but you do not have to draw any cards if you wish. So X can be as high as 3 and as low as 1 depending on how many you wish to draw.\n",
